    {
      "id": "MR03",
      "classification": "necessary",
      "status": "open",
      "title": "bootstrap測試harness在Windows產生不可編譯字串",
      "location": "tests/test_omni_mature_research.py:119",
      "finding": "測試把str(tmp_path)插入bootstrap的Python單引號literal。Windows路徑C:\\Users\\...會把\\U視為Unicode escape，測試在驗path traversal之前即SyntaxError。此為test/CI portability缺口；production的Linux /tmp bootstrap本身沒有這個錯誤。",
      "independent_counterexample": "用實際staged_bootstrap與相同三個replace，注入PureWindowsPath C:\\Users\\reviewer\\...，compile實際失敗 truncated \\UXXXXXXXX；只在private對照改as_posix後成功compile。未做Windows真OS執行，不假稱Windows CI通過。",
      "evidence": "current-bootstrap-windows-result.json",
      "required_resolution": "三個test replacement採POSIX路徑或安全的literal序列化，並回核原compile反例；不需改Linux產品bootstrap。"
    }
  ],
